 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29b-1§4 The falling block entity: worked example 8.1: the fall distance after ten ticks (vy - 0.04, move, x 0.98) is 0.04, 0.1192, 0.236816, 0.39208, ..." TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     MOVE 0 TO WS-RF1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-RF2
     PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > 10
         CALL "GB-FALL-STEP" USING WS-RF1 WS-RF2
         COMPUTE WS-R(WS-K) ROUNDED = WS-RF2 * 100000
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE 10 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "4000/11920/23682/39208/58424/81255/107630/137478/170728/207314" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29b-1§4 The falling block entity: landing 4.3: a moving piston stops, cancelDrop discards, a replaceable cell with survival and a solid cell below is placed (or retried/dropped" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1 0 1 1 0 1 1 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GB-LAND" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-I7 WS-I8 WS-R1
