     MOVE "acceptance US12 29b-1§4 The falling block entity: fall damage 4.6 (worked example 8.2): n = ceil(distance - 1), damage = min(floor(n x 2.0), 40), the anvil chips when nextFloat < 0.05 + n x 0.05" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "2.0 2.0 40 1 1 0.09" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
